  "technique.murimblock.cloud_step_slash.desc": "Hold the key to aim in the draw stance, let go to dash 5 blocks through everything on the way. In the air: a dive that knocks down. As a riposte: a short dash that cuts twice.",
  "technique.murimblock.thousand_drizzle.desc": "Within 3 blocks: six cuts that hold, a last one that sends flying, then every cut opens again on the body. Farther: a great ghost sword sent straight ahead. As a riposte: the last cut breaks the guard.",
