  "technique.murimblock.swallow_returns.desc": "Cloud Step Slash within a quarter second of a perfect parry: you appear behind the attacker and spin into a cut.",
  "passive.murimblock.flowing_cloud_stance": "Flowing Cloud Stance",
  "passive.murimblock.flowing_cloud_stance.desc": "Strikes that land restore 1 Qi. A perfect parry restores 6 Qi and opens a riposte: for 1.5 s, your next technique takes its riposte form for half its Qi.",
